  "name": "echo_alchemist_pixel_v1",
  "status": "provisional",
  "source": "docs/design/art_vfx_ui_direction_v1.md §2.3 (adopted 2026-10-22, A1 = 2 CSS px per art px)",
  "notes": [
    "Index 0 is reserved for full transparency and is not a color. Colors are indices 1..N.",
    "Ramps are ordered dark (step 1) to bright (step 5).",
    "Role tags: background = may appear in the background layer (no outline, no ramp step 4/5); interactable = enemies / pegs / marbles / facilities / icons (full range, auto 1px outline); feedback = VFX / numbers (ramp step 5 + white, glow does not get outlined).",
    "Low saturation for the background layer is a soft rule; the machine check only enforces the tag list.",
    "Wind has no dedicated ramp in v1: wind marks use the steel ramp (spare_a) plus cryo highlights. Change only by bumping the palette version; every manifest records the palette hash.",
    "The key colors #00FF00 and #FF00FF are intentionally NOT in this palette."
  ],
  "transparent_index": 0,
  "outline_id": "outline",
